# Added after an audit found these seven uncovered while the rest of the list was thorough.
# None exists in this repo today; they are insurance on the same reasoning as the secrets
# block near the bottom. `memory/` and `*.memory` matter most: an assistant that persists
# notes into the working tree is the likeliest way private context reaches a public repo.
.aider*
.continue/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
memory/
*.memory
.specstory/
.ai/

